{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>My terror.</b> It is fear in the soul, and weakness immediately comes to the body. This is \"and I will turn all your enemies toward you [their] back\" — that they will give you their back. The meaning: they will flee from before you when they see you."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:37:45.563475673Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}